{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/115993","id":3256998588,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc7CIdq8","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/115993","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/115993.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/115993.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/115993","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/115993/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/115993/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/115993/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/e3f73abe20aed559e2e8d2b08becfa949ad8ee1d","number":115993,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"Fix AHashMap realloc cause AnimationPlayer crash, second try","user":{"login":"xuhuisheng","id":1118508,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjExMTg1MDg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1118508?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/xuhuisheng","html_url":"https://github.com/xuhuisheng","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xuhuisheng/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xuhuisheng/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xuhuisheng/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xuhuisheng/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xuhuisheng/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xuhuisheng/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xuhuisheng/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xuhuisheng/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xuhuisheng/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"- Fixes: https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/112038\r\n- Related: https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/113039\r\n- Related: https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/113165\r\n\r\n# Issue Description\r\n\r\nAs mentioned in #113039, It is possible to rellocate memory when auto growing using `AHashMap`. So we shouldnot using `AHashMap` to store reference.\r\n\r\nAnd as metioned in  [the comments of #113039](https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/113039#pullrequestreview-3503262891). We decided to keep `AHashMap` to improve performance and let `AHashMap` store `animation_name` except the reference of animation.\r\n\r\n# Test Cases\r\n\r\nhttps://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/112038#issuecomment-3541837783\r\n\r\n[anim-map-crash-1.webm](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/894d1176-01ad-4fbf-96d0-d090152583f1)\r\n\r\nhttps://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/113165#issue-3664653936\r\n\r\n[anim-map-crash-2.webm](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/2c5f8f93-1e85-4707-b90e-aeda9a822403)\r\n\r\n# Etc\r\n\r\nAfter testing some projects, I find we need not check `animation_name` equals `stop`.  Please give me some suggestions. @TokageItLab ","labels":[{"id":73330064,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2NA==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/bug","name":"bug","description":"","color":"ff6055","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":1327318271,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwxMzI3MzE4Mjcx","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/crash","name":"crash","description":"","color":"885544","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":2666705648,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNjY2NzA1NjQ4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:animation","name":"topic:animation","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":{"id":14236899,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4A2Tzj","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/24","html_url":"https://github.c